# Mt. Ember and the islands' caves (FireRed's MUS_MT_EMBER and the caves of the Sevii Islands): a slow climb in D
# minor, a reedy lead over a smouldering low pulse, a warm pad and embers of bell. A cave plays the same by day and
# night. Original composition for this game (plan 19 · K9, part a).
